title Cassette playing Take 006 with Monitor on: the monitor is suspended, MON stays drawn but dark, the meter shows L R
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO playing
env CASSETTE_DEMO_MONITOR on
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
shot mon-lamp-playing
expect text "MON"
expect text "PLAY"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
